          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "Gel permeation chromatography (GPC) was performed on a Waters 150-C instrument using Styragel columns and a differential refractometer detector. The molecular weight calibration was carried out using polystyrene standards. Calibration and measurements were made at a flow rate of 1 ml/min, and dimethylformamide (DMF) was used as a solvent."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "P_6_83",
          "page": 6,
          "bbox": [
            87.0,
            93.0,
            500.0,
            249.0
          ],
          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "The molecular weights and dispersity of the polymers were investigated using the GPC method with DMF as a solvent calibrated with polystyrene standards."
        }
      ],
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
    },
